      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I recently had LV Solar install a full Enphase solar system at my property, including 30 panels with Enphase microinverters and Enphase batteries — and I couldn’t be happier with the entire experience.From the very beginning, their communication was clear, prompt, and professional. The team kept me well-informed at every stage, from quoting to installation, and made the whole process stress-free. The installation itself was exceptional, with real attention to detail, and the end result looks fantastic.The system has been performing flawlessly, and it’s been set up to provide full off-grid power backup. During power outages, my home continues to run seamlessly — which has been a huge reassurance. Having Enphase microinverters, ensures when there is shading on the panels from the trees, the panels are operating at their peak performance.I’d absolutely recommend LV Solar to anyone looking for a top-tier solar install. Their service, product knowledge, and professionalism were outstanding.",
